### Elenco servizi
GET http://localhost:3000/api/services

### Dettaglio servizio
GET http://localhost:3000/api/services/1

### Crea servizio
POST http://localhost:3000/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Taglio donna",
  "description": "Taglio e piega",
  "priceCents": 3500,
  "durationMin": 45,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Modifica servizio
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/services/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Taglio donna",
  "description": "Taglio e piega",
  "priceCents": 3500,
  "durationMin": 45,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Elimina servizio
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/services/1
